div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1400625-does-at-least-any-tribe-fera-have-their-own-level-6-things?p=1400674#post1400674\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I also presume the later. I'm not really sure why, esp. in W20, they didn't make sure to have at least one for each splat</div> </div> </div> </div>W20 avoids level 6 powers except for Garou Gifts. All canon level 6 powers of Fera don't <span style=\"color:#252c2f\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">even </span></span></span>appear in W20, except Rank 6 in Chart of Nagah and Gurahl<br /> <br /> I also don't know why authorities do this, well<br /> <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252c2f\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1400625-does-at-least-any-tribe-fera-have-their-own-level-6-things?p=1400674#post1400674\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">but I never got the impression it was meant to mean those are the only ones in existence.</div> </div> </div> </div>I never said this<br /> <br /> And I can provide an evidence: In </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Ragnar\u00f6k of ToJ, Black Fury unrevealed many secretive fetishes which were never known before, and used them to strike Maeljin very hard. But their revised book says their mightiest fetishes are just level 4 and 5</span></span></span></div> <div align=\"left\"><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Tip:<br /> the rarest level 6 thing in canon may be the Rite, only two canon rite, Raise the Sun and Vengeful Spider, are definitely level 6 ones, the Dragon Awakening in Apocalypse don't have level</span></span></span></div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24560-rock113","name":"Rock113","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24560_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-07T08:19:05-07:00","id":1401486,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1395272-all-rank-6-gifts-and-their-resources\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1395272-all-rank-6-gifts-and-their-resources\"> All Rank 6 Gifts and their resources? - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1395272-all-rank-6-gifts-and-their-resources\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1395272-all-rank-6-gifts-and-their-resources </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> The wyrmfoe list has a bit of mistakes and &amp;quot;lack (because this website needn't collect Fera and hsitorical Gifts)&amp;quot;, so I make my own list, please check it </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> All level 6 Gifts in canon","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24560-rock113","name":"Rock113","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24560_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-07T11:35:43-07:00","id":1401521,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rock113</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1400625-does-at-least-any-tribe-fera-have-their-own-level-6-things#post1400625\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In canon stuff some tribes/fera don't have level 6 things (Gifts/Rites/Fetishes/Rank/etc.), but are they really not having them? Or authorities simply didn't write them? I think it is latter</div> </div> </div> </div>The gifts we have are only the most common plus extra ones. If they make a product that introduces gifts those gifts probably aren't new, they are just letting us peak at a gift we weren't aware of.<br /> <br /> 